# Profile avatar and document signatures

Scope is only:

- My Profile avatar (private, circle crop/zoom) and signature upload
- Role-based Place / Clear stamp on Set C documents (quotation, work order, invoice, receipt, purchase order)
- Bake a signature copy into the document
- Stamp sets the slot name and designation
- Preview, PDF, and print show the baked image

Do not:

- Redesign Excel, clone Q5, overdue Q4, approvals, or other unrelated work
- Refactor, rename, or lint files this feature does not touch
- Upgrade dependencies unless this feature cannot work without it
- Take screenshots, screen recordings, or any visual browser QA
- Open, update, or merge a pull request unless the user asks

Prefer additive migrations. Match existing patterns. Keep diffs minimal.

Stop when this feature is implemented and checked (typecheck, lint on touched files, unit tests). Do not bump the package version to 1.1.0 unless the user asks to release it.
